fm-holder
=========

This product includes software developed by OmniOne (OmniOneID / OpenDID).

Vendored source
---------------
The package `org.omnione.did.base.datamodel.data` under
`src/main/java/org/omnione/did/base/datamodel/data/` is vendored verbatim from
the OmniOneID OpenDID reference server sources at version V2.0.0, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Each vendored `.java` file retains its original Apache-2.0 copyright header
("Copyright 2025 OmniOne").

Source of truth: the OpenDID TA server (did-ta-server) V2.0.0, which is the
single, self-consistent V2.0.0 datamodel source that fm-holder's existing
vendored `org.omnione.did.base.*` packages (enums, util, property, validation)
were already derived from. The datamodel DTOs required by fm-holder
(AccE2e, E2e, ServerTokenSeed, SignedDidDoc, SignedWalletInfo, Wallet, Proof,
Provider, ReqRevokeVc, and others) exist only in that complete V2.0.0 server
datamodel package; they are taken as one consistent version to avoid mixing DTO
revisions.

